<title>UK: CRICKET-SURREY BEAT KENT BY EIGHT WICKETS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SURREY BEAT KENT BY EIGHT WICKETS.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Surrey beat Kent by eight wickets in the final of the Benson and Hedges Cup (50 overs) on Saturday.</p>
<p>Scores: Kent 212-9 innings closed. Surrey 215-2 in 45 overs (B.Hollioake 98, A.Stewart 75 not out).</p>
